    {"symbol": "🛑", "tooltip": "A stop sign that only applies to certain brands while others speed past is not traffic regulation—it's a marketing filter."},
    {"symbol": "📳", "tooltip": "A smart speaker on silent mode still listens; a marketing-based ban won't hear what's happening at the hardware level."}
  ],
